# What the root Dockerfile copies: go.mod, go.sum and packages/pstack (its Go source, ui/,
# templates/ and package.json — assets.go embeds those three).
#
# Written as plain exclusions rather than `*` plus `!re-includes`: re-including a path whose PARENT
# was excluded by `*` is the fragile corner of .dockerignore, and this build has no way to fail
# loudly if it silently ships an empty context.
.git
.github
.turbo
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
apps
docs
skills
packages/client
packages/conformance
packages/pstack/bin
packages/pstack/examples
*.tgz
*.log
